@startuml
title A support ticket
[*] --> New
New --> Open : assigned
Open --> Waiting : asked the customer
Waiting --> Open : answered
Open --> Open : note
state Resolved {
  [*] --> Proposed
  Proposed --> Confirmed : accepted
}
Open --> Resolved : fixed
Resolved --> Open : reopened
New --> Closed : spam
Resolved --> Closed : after a week
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
